S2-v2 (.442 A1, exp4801) is the hardened, trustworthy re-test: n_effective_games=5/5,
positive_control_passed=True, candidates_genuinely_induced=True, DEGENERATE_CANDIDATE_POOL
does NOT fire. Verdict complete_structural_energy_s2v2_bounded_diverse_pool: energy-accuracy
off-path cell_recall delta -0.158, CI95 [-0.478, +0.004] (includes 0, slightly negative).
So on a genuine diverse test the off-path energy ranks induced engines no better than the
cheap accuracy gate. The energy is a real OFFLINE discriminator (S0'/S1) but adds no live
value at engine SELECTION. Per the pre-registered gate, BOUNDED -> S3 (generation lift, the
ARC wall, a different use). First live null; a genuine decision point (proceed to S3 vs reconsider).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
